---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const lang = 'en';
---
<Base lang={lang} title="Support PediBot — free for every parent, funded in the open" description="How PediBot is funded: the PDBT token on Base, a public monthly ledger, and the promise that nothing is ever gated." path="/support">
  <div class="narrow prose" style="padding:40px 18px">
    <p class="eyebrow">Support</p>
    <h1 style="margin-top:8px">Free for every parent. Funded in the open.</h1>
    <p class="lede">PediBot costs about €10 a month to run: a small server and a few cents of AI per hundred answers. It is funded through the <b>PDBT token</b> on the Base network — a way for people who believe in the project to back it, and to share in its visibility if it grows.</p>
    <h2>What the token is not</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>It is <b>not</b> required to use PediBot. Nothing here is gated, and never will be.</li>
      <li>There are no paid tiers, "premium answers" or discounts for holders.</li>
      <li>We do not make promises about its price and we do not pay for listings, trending or engagement.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>What we commit to</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>A <b>public monthly report</b>: what PediBot cost, how many questions it answered, what was built, and what the reserve did.</li>
      <li>Every movement of the project reserve is published with its on-chain transaction.</li>
      <li>Product news reach everyone at the same time — holders or not.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Token</h2>
    <p>PediBot (PDBT) · Base · contract <code class="mono">0x196A67BA334DbeD501E19BAEc47D217BB2FC15E1</code> · launched on Virtuals, now trading on Uniswap.</p>
    <h2>Ledger · August 2026</h2>
    <table class="plain"><tbody>
      <tr><td>AI answers (test runs, 220 questions)</td><td class="mono">0.15 USD</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Domain pedibot.xyz</td><td class="mono">bought 25 Aug</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Server</td><td class="mono">not yet</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Reserve movements</td><td class="mono">none yet</td></tr>
    </tbody></table>
  </div>
</Base>
